的甬//道被强行撑//开，那种火//辣//辣的疼痛，让你瞬间弓起了背，指甲深深地掐进了身下的沙发垫里。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:17","timestamp":1778552251236,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7789},{"id":1778551801495,"text":"“疼……”你哭着求他，“陆驰……我疼……”","rawContent":"“疼……”你哭着求他，“陆驰……我疼……”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:17","timestamp":1778552255767,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7790},{"id":1778551801496,"text":"陆驰的动作停了一下。","rawContent":"陆驰的动作停了一下。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:17","timestamp":1778552258376,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7791},{"id":1778551801497,"text":"他在你耳边喘着粗气，胸膛剧烈地起伏着。你甚至能感觉到，埋在你体//内的那根巨//物，因为你的眼泪而又涨//大了一圈。","rawContent":"他在你耳边喘着粗气，胸膛剧烈地起伏着。你甚至能感觉到，埋在你体//内的那根巨//物，因为你的眼泪而又涨//大了一圈。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:17","timestamp":1778552262905,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7792},{"id":1778551801498,"text":"“疼？”他用粗糙的指腹，抹去你脸上的泪水，动作称得上温柔，说出的话却残忍至极，“你拿着我给你买的包，去见别的男人，有没有想过，我的心会不会疼？”","rawContent":"“疼？”他用粗糙的指腹，抹去你脸上的泪水，动作称得上温柔，说出的话却残忍至极，“你拿着我给你买的包，去见别的男人，有没有想过，我的心会不会疼？”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:17","timestamp":1778552267435,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7793},{"id":1778551801499,"text":"他不再给你任何辩解的机会，开始大开大合地撞//击起来。","rawContent":"他不再给你任何辩解的机会，开始大开大合地撞//击起来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:17","timestamp":1778552271965,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7794},{"id":1778551801500,"text":"每一次顶//弄，都像是要将你整个人贯//穿。沙发因为剧烈的动作而发出“吱呀吱呀”的抗议声。你的身体被迫承受着他怒火的洗礼，快//感和痛楚交织在一起，将你的理智彻底撕碎。","rawContent":"每一次顶//弄，都像是要将你整个人贯//穿。沙发因为剧烈的动作而发出“吱呀吱呀”的抗议声。你的身体被迫承受着他怒火的洗礼，快//感和痛楚交织在一起，将你的理智彻底撕碎。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:17","timestamp":1778552276495,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7795},{"id":1778551801501,"text":"你不知道过了多久，久到你已经哭不出声，只能发泄般地在他后背上抓出一道道红痕。","rawContent":"你不知道过了多久，久到你已经哭不出声，只能发泄般地在他后背上抓出一道道红痕。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552281028,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7796},{"id":1778551801502,"text":"在濒临高//潮的那一刻，他却忽然停了下来。","rawContent":"在濒临高//潮的那一刻，他却忽然停了下来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552285555,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7797},{"id":1778551801503,"text":"他退了出去，让你悬在半空中，不上不下。","rawContent":"他退了出去，让你悬在半空中，不上不下。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552289906,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7798},{"id":1778551801504,"text":"“看着我。”他捏着你的下巴，强迫你睁开迷蒙的泪眼，“沈知意，说，你是谁的？”","rawContent":"“看着我。”他捏着你的下巴，强迫你睁开迷蒙的泪眼，“沈知意，说，你是谁的？”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552294435,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7799},{"id":1778551801505,"text":"你看着他布满血丝的眼睛，那里面有愤怒，有嫉妒，还有一丝你看不懂的、浓稠的悲伤。","rawContent":"你看着他布满血丝的眼睛，那里面有愤怒，有嫉妒，还有一丝你看不懂的、浓稠的悲伤。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552298965,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7800},{"id":1778551801506,"text":"你的心，像是被一只无形的手狠狠攥住，疼得快要喘不过气。","rawContent":"你的心，像是被一只无形的手狠狠攥住，疼得快要喘不过气。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552303494,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7801},{"id":1778551801507,"text":"“……是你的。”你用尽全身的力气，说出了这三个字，“陆驰，我是你的。”","rawContent":"“……是你的。”你用尽全身的力气，说出了这三个字，“陆驰，我是你的。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552308025,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7802},{"id":1778551801508,"text":"得到这个答案，他像是终于得到安抚的野兽，重新埋了进来，用一连串凶//狠的撞//击，将你送上了云端。","rawContent":"得到这个答案，他像是终于得到安抚的野兽，重新埋了进来，用一连串凶//狠的撞//击，将你送上了云端。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552312557,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7803},{"id":1778551801509,"text":"在你失神的瞬间，你听到他在你耳边，用一种近乎于叹息的声音说：","rawContent":"在你失神的瞬间，你听到他在你耳边，用一种近乎于叹息的声音说：","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552317085,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7804},{"id":1778551801510,"text":"“那就记住，别再让我看到你和别的男人在一起。不管是谁，不管是什么理由，都不行。”","rawContent":"“那就记住，别再让我看到你和别的男人在一起。不管是谁，不管是什么理由，都不行。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552321615,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7805},{"id":1778551801511,"text":"---","rawContent":"---","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552323085,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7806},{"id":1778551801512,"text":"沙发的余韵还未散去，你就被他从狼藉的战场上抱了起来。","rawContent":"沙发的余韵还未散去，你就被他从狼藉的战场上抱了起来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552327615,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7807},{"id":1778551801513,"text":"你以为结束了。","rawContent":"你以为结束了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552329925,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7808},{"id":1778551801514,"text":"但你很快就知道，自己错得有多离谱。","rawContent":"但你很快就知道，自己错得有多离谱。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552333946,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7809},{"id":1778551801515,"text":"他抱着你，走到了客厅中央那张柔软的波斯地毯上。他没有把你放下，而是让你跨//坐在他的腿上，以一种极其屈//辱的姿势，面对着他。","rawContent":"他抱着你，走到了客厅中央那张柔软的波斯地毯上。他没有把你放下，而是让你跨//坐在他的腿上，以一种极其屈//辱的姿势，面对着他。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:18","timestamp":1778552338475,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7810},{"id":1778551801516,"text":"“第二个，地毯。”他言简意赅。","rawContent":"“第二个，地毯。”他言简意赅。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:19","timestamp":1778552342164,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7811},{"id":1778551801517,"text":"你浑身赤//裸，而他还衣衫整齐，只有衬衫凌乱地敞开着，露出精壮的胸膛。这种鲜明的对比，让你羞耻得无地自容，下意识地想用手遮住自己的身体。","rawContent":"你浑身赤//裸，而他还衣衫整齐，只有衬衫凌乱地敞开着，露出精壮的胸膛。这种鲜明的对比，让你羞耻得无地自容，下意识地想用手遮住自己的身体。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:19","timestamp":1778552346695,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7812},{"id":1778551801518,"text":"“手拿开。”他命令道。","rawContent":"“手拿开。”他命令道。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:19","timestamp":1778552349784,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7813},{"id":1778551801519,"text":"你咬着唇，不动。","rawContent":"你咬着唇，不动。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:19","timestamp":1778552352517,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7814},{"id":1778551801520,"